OL,3,GNEWSAPark to be reinstated while sewer
OL,4,Aproject paused
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Liverpool park due to be dug up for a
OL,7,Fhuge underground water tank will be
OL,8,Ftemporarily reinstated while further
OL,9,Finvestigations are carried out.
OL,11,FUnited Utilities said it would restore
OL,12,Fgrass and remove temporary fencing at
OL,13,FWavertree Park, known locally as The
OL,14,FMystery, while work on the flood
OL,15,Fprevention scheme remains paused.
OL,17,FThe firm said it had "identified the
OL,18,Fneed for further assessments across the
OL,19,Fcatchment" as design work progressed
OL,20,Fand before construction could begin.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
