OL,3,GNEWSAPark to be reinstated while sewer
OL,4,Aproject paused
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteve Kenyon, from United Utilities,
OL,7,Fsaid reinstating the site ensured it
OL,8,Fwas not "unnecessarily occupied when
OL,9,Factive construction work is not taking
OL,10,Fplace".
